On Saturday morning, I finish my work at the café.
I come back to my building.
Moti is inside my flat.
I must take care while opening the door.
Asha's rule is, he must not go outside alone.
I open the lock and slowly open the door.
But Moti is very excited.
He immediately runs out of the door.
"Oh god!" I say.
He goes ahead in the long hallway.
"Moti, stop there!" I shout.
"Don't go ahead!"
He stops and looks at me.
"Come back here!"
"Come to me," I tell him.
But he does not move at all.
I must catch him quickly.
I quickly go towards him and grab his collar.
"Good boy."
"Now come inside," I say to him.
We both safely go back into the flat.
